REM 🐙 GitHub Repository & Workflow Explorer Macro
REM Title: 🐙 GitHub Workflow Explorer
REM Description: Opens trending repositories on GitHub, inspects active repositories, scrolls discussions and captures state.
REM Tags: developer, github, git, open-source
REM Variables: REPO_URL, OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT

VAR REPO_URL=https://github.com/trending
VAR OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT=github_trending.png

LOG Navigating to GitHub: $REPO_URL
NAVIGATE $REPO_URL
WAIT_FOR article.Box-row, main, .application-main 10000
RANDOM_DELAY 1200 2200

LOG Inspecting trending developer repositories
SCROLL 500
RANDOM_DELAY 1400 2400
SCROLL 500
RANDOM_DELAY 1200 2000

SCREENSHOT $OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT
LOG GitHub trending state captured to $OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT
